OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested over major fire at
OL,4,AFolkestone hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Ffire at a seaside hotel which led to
OL,8,Fhundreds of people being evacuated.
OL,10,FKent Police said a 38-year-old man and
OL,11,F21-year-old woman were held after the
OL,12,Fblaze at the Grand Burstin Hotel in
OL,13,FFolkestone on Saturday.
OL,15,FThe fire broke out at the hotel in
OL,16,FMarine Parade in the early hours and
OL,17,Fabout 280 people were evacuated from
OL,18,Fthe building.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
